BT /F1 10 Tf 56 771.5 Td (- Annual Declaration: A conflict of interest declaration must be submitted every year by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 757.0 Td (  30 April. This declaration requires employees to disclose any external business) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 742.5 Td (  interests, family relationships with competitors, or other potential conflicts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 728.0 Td (- Ongoing Disclosure: Employees must also report any new conflicts of interest immediately) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 713.5 Td (  upon discovery, rather than waiting for the annual submission deadline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 699.0 Td (- Management Review: All submitted declarations are reviewed by the HR and Compliance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 684.5 Td (  departments. Where a conflict is identified, appropriate mitigation measures will be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 670.0 Td (  implemented, which may include recusal from specific decisions or reassignment of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 655.5 Td (  duties.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 613.4 Td (Raising a Grievance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 584.4 Td (Kestrel Shipmanagement is committed to resolving workplace issues fairly and efficiently.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 569.9 Td (The following procedure outlines the steps for raising and addressing grievances.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 540.9 Td (- Initial Step: Employees should raise their grievance first with the HR business partner) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 526.4 Td (  assigned to their department. The HR business partner will conduct an initial review and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 511.9 Td (  attempt to facilitate a resolution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 497.4 Td (- Escalation Path: If the issue remains unresolved after discussion with the HR business) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 482.9 Td (  partner, the case may be escalated to the Grievance Committee. This committee comprises) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 468.4 Td (  senior management representatives and is empowered to make binding decisions on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 453.9 Td (  workplace disputes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 439.4 Td (- Resolution Timeline: The target is to resolve a grievance within 15 working days from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 424.9 Td (  the date of formal submission to the appropriate authority. Employees will be kept) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 410.4 Td (  informed of the progress throughout the process.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 368.4 Td (Prevention of Sexual Harassment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 339.4 Td (Kestrel Shipmanagement maintains a zero-tolerance policy toward sexual harassment. We are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 324.9 Td (dedicated to providing a safe and respectful work environment for all staff members.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 295.9 Td (- Reporting Mechanism: Complaints regarding sexual harassment must be directed to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 281.4 Td (  Internal Committee \(IC\). The IC is an independent body established specifically to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 266.9 Td (  handle such sensitive matters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 252.4 Td (- Inquiry Process: Upon receipt of a complaint, the Internal Committee will initiate a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 237.9 Td (  formal inquiry. This process ensures confidentiality and impartiality while gathering) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 223.4 Td (  all necessary facts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 208.9 Td (- Timeline for Resolution: The Internal Committee must complete its inquiry within 90 days) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 194.4 Td (  from the date of filing the complaint. Both parties involved will be notified of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 179.9 Td (  findings and any subsequent actions taken.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 137.8 Td (Notice Period and Exit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 108.8 Td (Clear procedures govern the termination of employment to ensure a smooth transition for both) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 94.3 Td (the employee and the company.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 56 28 Td (Kestrel Shipmanagement \(fictional company\) - HR-POL-07 v1.5 - page 3 of 4) Tj ET
endstream
